==English==
[[File:Dracaena_draco.jpg|thumb]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several trees, of the [[genus]] ''[[Dracaena]]'', having a thick [[trunk]], [[sword]]-[[shaped]] [[leaves]] and [[orange]] [[fruit]], especially {{taxlink|Dracaena draco|species}}, of the [[Canary Islands]] – the source of [[dragon's blood]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2018|author=w:Tim Flannery| title=Europe: A Natural History| page=97| passage=Another ancient vegetable relic surviving in Macaronesia is the legendary '''dragon tree''', whose sap, marketed as dragon&rsquo;s blood, was in past times much prized as a medicine, as incense and as a dye.}}

